I've been playing Nethack for a couple years now, and for a while I
thought I'd never make it to the end, but I did it today! I did
basically everything one could do; this was the first game I'd ever
tried alchemy, for instance. I also might have taken a little longer
than I should have, but I made it!

My previous best was a barbarian that I got to the Plane of Fire
before I panicked and accidentally drowned in lava. I got lucky and
the first altar I went to was coaligned. This is only the second
character I've ever gotten the Amulet with; the early game really is
the hard part. This is also the first time I've beaten Master Kaen.

I couldn't get a copy of my inventory, but it was mostly normal stuff,
I had equipped

+6 elven helm
Eyes of the Overworld
+5 grey dragon scale mail
+4 robe
+4 boots of speed
+5 shield of reflection
+4 gauntlets of dexterity
+5 t-shirt

for a final ac of -48. I had some K-Rations and royal jelly, and only
Orcus's wand of death. I had way too much junk; I was almost burdened
for basically the whole ascension run, but I was so afraid I'd leave
something I needed behind.

I'm just so excited right now.

